WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.382 line:85%
I was the first spacecraft ever to fly through the asteroid belt!

2
00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.079 line:85%
I'm Pioneer 10.

3
00:00:07.169 --> 00:00:11.261 line:85%
I launched on March 2, 1972.

4
00:00:11.351 --> 00:00:15.083 line:85%
Then I became the first spacecraft to fly past Jupiter.

5
00:00:15.173 --> 00:00:20.719 line:85%
I was designed for a 21-month mission, but I lasted more than 30 years!

6
00:00:20.809 --> 00:00:26.532 line:85%
My last signal reached Earth on January 23, 2003.

7
00:00:26.622 --> 00:00:29.581 line:85%
Now I'm heading toward the red star Aldebaran.

8
00:00:29.671 --> 00:00:32.898 line:85%
I should pass it in about two million years!

9
00:00:32.988 --> 00:00:35.509 line:85%
Where would you go if you could travel forever?
